›▾ 1 prod (empty)           │                                                   
                            │                                                   
                            │                                                   
                            │  No connections in idle yet.                      
                            │                                                   
                            │  a add: a new group, here on a group header. To   
                            │  add a connection to prod, run sshctl add         
                            │  <alias> --space idle --group prod.               
                            │                                                   
                            │  Hosts already in ~/.ssh/config show up in Space  
                            │  default. Saving needs Include sshctl_config at   
                            │  the top of ~/.ssh/config; sshctl asks before     
                            │  adding it.                                       
                            │                                                   
                            │  P spaces: switch, add or rename Spaces.          
                            │                                                   
                            │  ^B ? help: every key.                            
